{"story_id":88442,"updated_at":"2026-11-21T02:14:06","headline_en":"Mumbai music festival: Charlie Puth and Ellie Goulding to headline debut","headline_hi":"मुंबई म्यूजिक फेस्टिवल: चार्ली पुथ और एली गोल्डिंग डेब्यू को हेडलाइन करेंगे","payload_en":{"story_id":88442,"headline":"Mumbai music festival: Charlie Puth and Ellie Goulding to headline debut","counts":{"articles":2,"independent_sources":2,"outlets":2},"has_established":false,"qualified_by":"express","perspective_mode":"none","perspectives":{"–":["Hindustan Times","News18"]},"framing":[],"suicide":false,"thread":88442,"parents":[],"children":[],"written_at":"2026-11-21T02:14:06","category":{"v":2,"primary":["india"],"secondary":["life"],"tertiary":["sport-films"]},"places":["maharashtra"],"people":["Charlie Puth","Ellie Goulding","Co Festival","Johnnie","Mahalaxmi Racecourse","Gini","HSBC","Mali"],"narrative":{"paragraphs":[[{"text":"Charlie Puth and Ellie Goulding will perform at the Johnnie & Co. Festival in Mumbai on 13 February 2027.","ids":[154751],"class":"partial","sources":[1,2]}],[{"text":"The announcement (The announcement was made on Friday) of the festival was made yesterday.","ids":[154766],"class":"single","sources":[2]},{"text":"It will be held at Mahalaxmi Racecourse in Mumbai, where Puth and Goulding will perform at the inaugural event on 13 February 2027.","ids":[154753,154752],"parts":[{"text":"It will be held at Mahalaxmi Racecourse in Mumbai, where","ids":[154753],"class":"single"},{"text":"Puth and Goulding will perform at the inaugural event on 13 February 2027.","ids":[154752],"class":"partial"}],"class":"single","sources":[1,2]}],[{"text":"Kayan, Taba Chake, Mali and Gini were confirmed to perform at the festival, which would feature Indian independent musicians.","ids":[154755,154758],"parts":[{"text":"Kayan, Taba Chake, Mali and Gini were confirmed to perform at the festival,","ids":[154755],"class":"unverified"},{"text":"which would feature Indian independent musicians.","ids":[154758],"class":"single"}],"class":"single","sources":[1,2]},{"text":"They would join Puth and Goulding at the event.","ids":[154770],"class":"single","sources":[2]}],[{"text":"HSBC pre-sale ticket bookings would occur on 23 November and 24, 2026, and general ticket sales would begin on 25 November 2026.","ids":[154756,154757],"class":"single","sources":[1]},{"text":"Tickets would be available through BookMyShow in two phases, updating an earlier plan for a pre-sale on 23 November and 24, 2026.","ids":[154760,154768],"class":"single","sources":[1,2]}],[{"text":"\"I’ve heard so much about the energy of Indian fans, and I’m really excited to finally be performing in India for the first time,\" Puth said.","ids":[154764],"class":"single","sources":[2]}],[{"text":"Fans expressed excitement on social media regarding the concert announcement.","ids":[154774],"class":"single","sources":[2]}],[{"text":"Organisers anticipate more than 35,000 attendees for the festival.","ids":[154754],"class":"unverified","sources":[1,2]}],[{"text":"The festival would be held at Mahalaxmi Racecourse in Mumbai.","ids":[154761],"class":"single","sources":[1]}],[{"text":"The 2027 wider cultural initiative includes the Johnnie & Co. Festival.","ids":[154773],"class":"single","sources":[2]}]],"section_keys":["news","happened","happened","happened","words","say","numbers","explained","related"],"sources":[{"n":1,"url":"https://www.news18.com/movies/hollywood/charlie-puth-and-ellie-goulding-to-perform-in-india-for-the-first-time-at-mumbai-music-festival-details-inside-ws-kl-10434512.html","outlet":"News18","title":"Charlie Puth And Ellie Goulding To Perform In India For The First Time At Mumbai Music Festival; Details Inside","perspective":"–","read":true,"readable":true},{"n":2,"url":"https://www.hindustantimes.com/entertainment/music/charlie-puth-excited-for-his-debut-in-india-with-ellie-goulding-at-mumbai-music-festival-in-2027-taba-chake-gini-kayan-mali-to-join-them-101795178712784.html","outlet":"H