h and Ellie Goulding at the festival.","verdict":"unverified","n_sources":1,"sources":[{"outlet":"Hindustan Times","url":"https://www.hindustantimes.com/entertainment/music/charlie-puth-excited-for-his-debut-in-india-with-ellie-goulding-at-mumbai-music-festival-in-2027-taba-chake-gini-kayan-mali-to-join-them-101795178712784.html","stance":"asserts"}]}],"context":[{"text":"The Johnnie & Co. Festival is part of a larger cultural initiative planned for 2027.","verdict":"unverified","n_sources":1,"sources":[{"outlet":"Hindustan Times","url":"https://www.hindustantimes.com/entertainment/music/charlie-puth-excited-for-his-debut-in-india-with-ellie-goulding-at-mumbai-music-festival-in-2027-taba-chake-gini-kayan-mali-to-join-them-101795178712784.html","stance":"asserts"}]},{"text":"The festival will be held at Mahalaxmi Racecourse in Mumbai.","verdict":"unverified","n_sources":1,"sources":[{"outlet":"News18","url":"https://www.news18.com/movies/hollywood/charlie-puth-and-ellie-goulding-to-perform-in-india-for-the-first-time-at-mumbai-music-festival-details-inside-ws-kl-10434512.html","stance":"asserts"}]},{"text":"Fans expressed excitement on social media regarding the concert announcement.","verdict":"unverified","n_sources":1,"sources":[{"outlet":"Hindustan Times","url":"https://www.hindustantimes.com/entertainment/music/charlie-puth-excited-for-his-debut-in-india-with-ellie-goulding-at-mumbai-music-festival-in-2027-taba-chake-gini-kayan-mali-to-join-them-101795178712784.html","stance":"asserts"}]},{"text":"A fan expressed excitement about the concert coinciding with their birthday.","verdict":"unverified","n_sources":1,"sources":[{"outlet":"Hindustan Times","url":"https://www.hindustantimes.com/entertainment/music/charlie-puth-excited-for-his-debut-in-india-with-ellie-goulding-at-mumbai-music-festival-in-2027-taba-chake-gini-kayan-mali-to-join-them-101795178712784.html","stance":"attributes"}]}]},"payload_hi":{"story_id":88442,"headline":"मुंबई म्यूजिक फेस्टिवल: चार्ली पुथ और एली गोल्डिंग डेब्यू को हेडलाइन करेंगे","counts":{"articles":2,"independent_sources":2,"outlets":2},"has_established":false,"qualified_by":"express","perspective_mode":"none","perspectives":{"–":["Hindustan Times","News18"]},"framing":[],"suicide":false,"thread":88442,"parents":[],"children":[],"written_at":"2026-11-21T02:14:06","category":{"v":2,"primary":["india"],"secondary":["life"],"tertiary":["sport-films"]},"places":["maharashtra"],"people":["Charlie Puth","Ellie Goulding","Co Festival","Johnnie","Mahalaxmi Racecourse","Gini","HSBC","Mali"],"narrative":{"paragraphs":[[{"text":"चार्ली पुथ और एली गोल्डिंग 13 फरवरी 2027 को मुंबई में जॉनी एंड को. फेस्टिवल में परफॉर्म करेंगे।","ids":[154751],"class":"partial","sources":[1,2]}],[{"text":"फेस्टिवल की घोषणा (The announcement was made on Friday) कल की गई थी।","ids":[154766],"class":"single","sources":[2]},{"text":"यह मुंबई के महालक्ष्मी रेसकोर्स में आयोजित किया जाएगा, जहां पुथ और गोल्डिंग 13 फरवरी 2027 को उद्घाटन कार्यक्रम में परफॉर्म करेंगे।","ids":[154753,154752],"class":"single","sources":[1,2]}],[{"text":"क्यान्, ताबा चाके, माली और गिनी को फेस्टिवल में परफॉर्म करने के लिए कन्फर्म किया गया था, जिसमें भारतीय स्वतंत्र संगीतकार शामिल होंगे।","ids":[154755,154758],"class":"single","sources":[1,2]},{"text":"वे कार्यक्रम में पुथ और गोल्डिंग के साथ शामिल होंगे।","ids":[154770],"class":"single","sources":[2]}],[{"text":"एचएसबीसी प्री-सेल टिकट बुकिंग 23 नवंबर और 24, 2026 को होनी थी, और सामान्य टिकट बिक्री 25 नवंबर 2026 को शुरू होनी थी।","ids":[154756,154757],"class":"single","sources":[1]},{"text":"टिकट बुकमाईशो के माध्यम से दो चरणों में उपलब्ध होने थे, जो 23 नवंबर और 24, 2026 को प्री-सेल की पिछली योजना को अपडेट कर रहे थे।","ids":[154760,154768],"class":"single","sources":[1,2]}],[{"text":"पुथ ने कहा, \"मैंने भारतीय प्रशंसकों की ऊर्जा के बारे में बहुत कुछ सुना है, और मैं आखिरकार पहली बार भारत में परफॉर्म करने के लिए वास्तव में उत्साहित हूं।\"","ids":[154764],"class":"single","sources":[2]}],[{"text":"प्रशंसकों ने कॉन्स